Rule 1 (steps must be non-negative)
{v_1 : int} |= v_1 ≥ 0
>>
Rule 2 (start and end must be 0-dimensional tensors if they are tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 0
>>
Rule 3 (dtype of out tensor should match the dtype of start and end if specified)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_3) ≠ 0 then dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_3) ∧ dtype_(v_2) = dtype_(v_3)
